+7)"},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block-2024__description-block-heading","text":"Traits"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Amphibious."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The kraken can breathe air and water."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Legendary Resistance (4/Day, or 5/Day in Lair)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"If the kraken fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Siege Monster."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The kraken deals double damage to objects and structures."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block-2024__description-block-heading","text":"Actions"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Multiattack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The kraken makes two Tentacle attacks and uses Fling, Lightning Strike, or Swallow."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Tentacle."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Attack Roll:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+17"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":", reach 30 ft."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"24"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(4d6 + 10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Bludgeoning damage. The target has the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Grappled"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"condition (escape DC 20) from one of ten tentacles, and it has the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Restrained"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"condition until the grapple ends."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Fling."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The kraken throws a Large or smaller creature"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Grappled"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"by it to a space it can see within 60 feet of itself that isn’t in the air."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Dexterity Saving Throw:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"DC 25, the creature thrown and each creature in the destination space."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Failure:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"18"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(4d8)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Bludgeoning damage, and the target has the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Prone"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"condition."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Success:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Half damage only."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Lightning Strike."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Dexterity Saving Throw:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"DC 23, one creature the kraken can see within 120 feet."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Failure:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"33"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(6d10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Lightning damage."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Success:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Half damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Swallow."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Dexterity Saving Throw:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"DC 25, one creature"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Grappled"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"by the kraken (it can have up to four creatures swallowed at a time)."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Failure:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"23"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(3d8 + 10)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Piercing damage. If the target is Large or smaller, it is swallowed and no longer Grappled. A swallowed creature has the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Restrained"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"condition, has"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover rule-tooltip","text":"Total Cover"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"against attacks and other effects outside the kraken, and takes 24"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(7d6)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"Acid damage at the start of each of its turns."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"If the kraken takes 50 damage or more on a single turn from a creature inside it, the kraken must succeed on a DC 25 Constitution saving throw at the end of that turn or regurgitate all swallowed creatures, each of which falls in a space within 10 feet of the kraken with the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Prone"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"condition. If the kraken dies, any swallowed creature no longer has the Restrained condition and can escape from the corpse using 15 feet of movement, exiting Prone."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block-2024__description-block-heading","text":"Legendary Actions"},{"element":"p","class":"legendary-actions","text":"Legendary Action Uses: 3 (4 in Lair). Immediately after another creature’s turn, the kraken can expend a use to take one of the following actions. The kraken regains all expended uses at the start of each of its turns."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Storm Bolt."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The kraken uses Lightning Strike."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Toxic Ink."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Constitution Saving Throw:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"DC 23, each creature in a 15-foot Emanation originating from the kraken while it is underwater."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Failure:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The target has the"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Blinded"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"and"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover condition-tooltip","text":"Poisoned"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"conditions until the end of the kraken’s next turn. The kraken then moves up to its Speed."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Failure or Success:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The kraken can’t take this action again until the start of its next turn."}],"tags":160,"max_dom_depth":7}